# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [1.0.0] - 2025-05-16
### Added
- Consolidated documentation into root README and docs/DOCUMENTATION.md
- Added version/document control table
- Added mermaid and PlantUML diagrams for architecture, microservices, data flow, and containerization
- Added Next Steps & Future Enhancements section
- Improved documentation structure and anchors

### Changed
- Updated .gitignore to ensure logic files are tracked
- Improved backend model status and error handling
- Added notification and settings UI components to frontend

### Fixed
- Fixed model import bug in processing service
- Fixed download service error handling for spotdl

---

## Next Steps
- Continue UI/UX improvements (notification log, settings, debug console, player, playlist enhancements)
- Add more diagrams and advanced documentation
- Expand test coverage and CI/CD
